OL,3,GNEWSAFans pay tribute to Liam Payne two
OL,4,Ayears on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial has been set up in tribute
OL,7,Fto One Direction star Liam Payne to
OL,8,Fmark the second anniversary of his
OL,9,Fdeath.
OL,11,FFans from as far as New Zealand and the
OL,12,FUS have left heartfelt messages in
OL,13,Fhonour of the singer in his home city
OL,14,Fof Wolverhampton.
OL,16,FThe bandstand in West Park has been
OL,17,Fadorned with banners, photos, toys and
OL,18,Fflowers as well as a red letter box for
OL,19,Fprivate messages to be left.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
